{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 15,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 542.675,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after I, Nephi, had been carried away in the Spirit,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.731,
      "end": 6.31,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and seen all these things,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.49,
      "end": 8.858,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I returned to the tent of my father.",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.538,
      "end": 12.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld my brethren,",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.597,
      "end": 14.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were disputing one with another",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 15.099,
      "end": 18.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the things which my father had spoken unto them.",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.123,
      "end": 22.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he truly spake many great things unto them,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.322,
      "end": 24.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were hard to be understood,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.545,
      "end": 26.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save a man should inquire of the Lord;",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.093,
      "end": 29.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they being hard in their hearts,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.013,
      "end": 33.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they did not look unto the Lord as they ought.",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 33.851,
      "end": 38.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, was grieved because of the hardness of their hearts,",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 38.489,
      "end": 41.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, because of the things which I had seen,",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 41.734,
      "end": 49.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and knew they must unavoidably come to pass because of the great wickedness of the children of men.",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.705,
      "end": 53.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I was overcome because of my afflictions,",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 53.786,
      "end": 60.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I considered that mine afflictions were great above all, because of the destruction of my people,",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 60.607,
      "end": 62.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I had beheld their fall.",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 63.423,
      "end": 66.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after I had received strength",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 66.761,
      "end": 68.665,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I spake unto my brethren,",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 68.845,
      "end": 72.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "desiring to know of them the cause of their disputations.",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 73.194,
      "end": 82.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they said: Behold, we cannot understand the words which our father hath spoken concerning the natural branches of the olive tree,",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 82.941,
      "end": 85.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also concerning the Gentiles.",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 85.711,
      "end": 87.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto them:",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 87.47,
      "end": 89.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Have ye inquired of the Lord?",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 90.008,
      "end": 91.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they said unto me:",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 91.813,
      "end": 93.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We have not;",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 93.433,
      "end": 96.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord maketh no such thing known unto us.",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 97.039,
      "end": 98.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I said unto them:",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 98.844,
      "end": 102.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How is it that ye do not keep the commandments of the Lord?",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 102.553,
      "end": 106.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How is it that ye will perish, because of the hardness of your hearts?",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 107.366,
      "end": 109.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do ye not remember the things which the Lord hath said?\u2014",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 110.147,
      "end": 113.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If ye will not harden your hearts, and ask me in faith,",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 113.671,
      "end": 118.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "believing that ye shall receive, with diligence in keeping my commandments,",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 118.588,
      "end": 121.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "surely these things shall be made known unto you.",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 122.194,
      "end": 123.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 124.046,
      "end": 130.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the house of Israel was compared unto an olive tree by the Spirit of the Lord which was in our father;",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 130.82,
      "end": 134.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold are we not broken off from the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 134.715,
      "end": 137.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and are we not a branch of the house of Israel?",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 138.274,
      "end": 140.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, the thing which our father meaneth",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 141.055,
      "end": 144.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the grafting in of the natural branches",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 144.486,
      "end": 146.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "through the fulness of the Gentiles, is,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 146.942,
      "end": 148.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that in the latter days,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 148.933,
      "end": 152.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when our seed shall have dwindled in unbelief,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 152.364,
      "end": 155.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, for the space of many years, and many generations",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 156.166,
      "end": 161.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after the Messiah shall be manifested in body unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 161.408,
      "end": 166.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then shall the fulness of the gospel of the Messiah come unto the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 166.418,
      "end": 169.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from the Gentiles unto the remnant of our seed\u2014",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 170.488,
      "end": 171.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And at that day",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 172.108,
      "end": 180.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall the remnant of our seed know that they are of the house of Israel, and that they are the covenant people of the Lord;",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 180.601,
      "end": 182.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then shall they know",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 182.221,
      "end": 184.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come to the knowledge of their forefathers,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 185.095,
      "end": 187.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also to the knowledge of the gospel of their Redeemer,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 188.108,
      "end": 191.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was ministered unto their fathers by him;",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 191.817,
      "end": 196.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they shall come to the knowledge of their Redeemer",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 196.362,
      "end": 198.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the very points of his doctrine,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 198.725,
      "end": 202.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may know how to come unto him and be saved.",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 203.352,
      "end": 205.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then at that day will they not rejoice",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 205.9,
      "end": 208.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and give praise unto their everlasting God,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 208.727,
      "end": 210.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their rock and their salvation?",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 211.09,
      "end": 212.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, at that day,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 212.663,
      "end": 216.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will they not receive the strength and nourishment from the true vine?",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 216.883,
      "end": 219.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, will they not come unto the true fold of God?",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 220.257,
      "end": 221.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 222.109,
      "end": 225.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea; they shall be remembered again among the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 225.865,
      "end": 227.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be grafted in,",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 227.67,
      "end": 232.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being a natural branch of the olive tree, into the true olive tree.",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 233.412,
      "end": 235.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this is what our father meaneth;",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 235.682,
      "end": 238.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he meaneth that it will not come to pass",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 238.463,
      "end": 241.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until after they are scattered by the Gentiles;",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 241.29,
      "end": 244.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he meaneth that it shall come by way of the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 244.767,
      "end": 248.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord may show his power unto the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 248.244,
      "end": 251.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the very cause that he shall be rejected of the Jews,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 252.139,
      "end": 253.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 254.398,
      "end": 258.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, our father hath not spoken of our seed alone,",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 258.943,
      "end": 263.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but also of all the house of Israel, pointing to the covenant",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 263.488,
      "end": 266.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which should be fulfilled in the latter days;",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 266.222,
      "end": 269.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which covenant the Lord made to our father Abraham, saying:",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 270.024,
      "end": 273.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In thy seed shall all the kindreds of the earth be blessed.",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 274.28,
      "end": 279.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Nephi, spake much unto them concerning these things;",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 279.661,
      "end": 284.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I spake unto them concerning the restoration of the Jews in the latter days.",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 284.846,
      "end": 288.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I did rehearse unto them the words of Isaiah,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 288.323,
      "end": 291.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who spake concerning the restoration of the Jews,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 291.986,
      "end": 293.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or of the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 294.024,
      "end": 295.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after they were restored",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 296.108,
      "end": 298.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they should no more be confounded,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 298.61,
      "end": 300.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither should they be scattered again.",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 300.973,
      "end": 306.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I did speak many words unto my brethren, that they were pacified",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 306.819,
      "end": 309.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did humble themselves before the Lord.",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 309.775,
      "end": 313.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did speak unto me again, saying:",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 313.856,
      "end": 317.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What meaneth this thing which our father saw in a dream?",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 317.194,
      "end": 319.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What meaneth the tree which he saw?",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 320.15,
      "end": 321.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto them:",
      "verse": "15:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 321.909,
      "end": 324.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It was a representation of the tree of life.",
      "verse": "15:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 325.375,
      "end": 327.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they said unto me:",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 327.18,
      "end": 331.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What meaneth the rod of iron which our father saw, that led to the tree?",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 332.272,
      "end": 335.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto them that it was the word of God;",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 335.656,
      "end": 338.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whoso would hearken unto the word of God,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 338.762,
      "end": 340.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and would hold fast unto it,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 340.892,
      "end": 342.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would never perish;",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 342.837,
      "end": 346.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither could the temptations and the fiery darts of the adversary",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 346.964,
      "end": 349.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "overpower them unto blindness,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 349.466,
      "end": 351.742,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to lead them away to destruction.",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 352.422,
      "end": 354.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I, Nephi, did exhort them",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 355.156,
      "end": 357.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to give heed unto the word of the Lord;",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 357.704,
      "end": 361.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I did exhort them with all the energies of my soul,",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 361.46,
      "end": 364.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with all the faculty which I possessed,",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 364.38,
      "end": 367.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would give heed to the word of God",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 367.254,
      "end": 370.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remember to keep his commandments always in all things.",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 371.185,
      "end": 372.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they said unto me:",
      "verse": "15:26",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 372.99,
      "end": 376.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What meaneth the river of water which our father saw?",
      "verse": "15:26",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 376.921,
      "end": 378.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto them",
      "verse": "15:27",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 378.819,
      "end": 382.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the water which my father saw was filthiness;",
      "verse": "15:27",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 382.436,
      "end": 385.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and so much was his mind swallowed up in other things",
      "verse": "15:27",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 385.635,
      "end": 389.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he beheld not the filthiness of the water.",
      "verse": "15:27",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 390.216,
      "end": 393.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto them that it was an awful gulf,",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 393.415,
      "end": 396.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which separated the wicked from the tree of life,",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 396.799,
      "end": 398.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also from the saints of God.",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 399.429,
      "end": 401.147,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto them",
      "verse": "15:29",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 401.327,
      "end": 407.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it was a representation of that awful hell, which the angel said unto me was prepared for the wicked.",
      "verse": "15:29",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 408.23,
      "end": 415.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto them that our father also saw that the justice of God did also divide the wicked from the righteous;",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 416.073,
      "end": 417.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the brightness thereof",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 418.018,
      "end": 421.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was like unto the brightness of a flaming fire,",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 421.449,
      "end": 424.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ascendeth up unto God forever and ever,",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 424.973,
      "end": 426.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath no end.",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 427.418,
      "end": 429.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they said unto me:",
      "verse": "15:31",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 429.223,
      "end": 433.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Doth this thing mean the torment of the body in the days of probation,",
      "verse": "15:31",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 433.815,
      "end": 438.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or doth it mean the final state of the soul after the death of the temporal body,",
      "verse": "15:31",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 438.964,
      "end": 442.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or doth it speak of the things which are temporal?",
      "verse": "15:31",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 442.941,
      "end": 445.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I said unto them",
      "verse": "15:32",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 445.815,
      "end": 450.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it was a representation of things both temporal and spiritual;",
      "verse": "15:32",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 451.103,
      "end": 455.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the day should come that they must be judged of their works,",
      "verse": "15:32",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 455.277,
      "end": 460.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the works which were done by the temporal body in their days of probation.",
      "verse": "15:32",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 460.973,
      "end": 464.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if they should die in their wickedness",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 464.264,
      "end": 466.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they must be cast off also,",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 466.348,
      "end": 468.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as to the things which are spiritual,",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 468.804,
      "end": 471.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are pertaining to righteousness;",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 471.538,
      "end": 474.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they must be brought to stand before God,",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 474.644,
      "end": 476.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be judged of their works;",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 476.728,
      "end": 481.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if their works have been filthiness they must needs be filthy;",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 481.366,
      "end": 486.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if they be filthy it must needs be that they cannot dwell in the kingdom of God;",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 486.376,
      "end": 489.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if so, the kingdom of God must be filthy also.",
      "verse": "15:33",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 490.075,
      "end": 491.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "15:34",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 492.066,
      "end": 494.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the kingdom of God is not filthy,",
      "verse": "15:34",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 494.568,
      "end": 496.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there cannot any unclean thing",
      "verse": "15:34",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 497.163,
      "end": 499.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "enter into the kingdom of God;",
      "verse": "15:34",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 499.479,
      "end": 503.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore there must needs be a place of filthiness",
      "verse": "15:34",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 503.188,
      "end": 505.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "prepared for that which is filthy.",
      "verse": "15:34",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 506.329,
      "end": 511.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there is a place prepared, yea, even that awful hell of which I have spoken,",
      "verse": "15:35",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 511.571,
      "end": 513.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the devil is the preparator of it;",
      "verse": "15:35",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 514.166,
      "end": 517.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore the final state of the souls of men",
      "verse": "15:35",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 517.55,
      "end": 523.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is to dwell in the kingdom of God, or to be cast out because of that justice of which I have spoken.",
      "verse": "15:35",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 523.896,
      "end": 527.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the wicked are rejected from the righteous,",
      "verse": "15:36",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 527.234,
      "end": 529.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also from that tree of life,",
      "verse": "15:36",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 529.597,
      "end": 532.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose fruit is most precious",
      "verse": "15:36",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 532.192,
      "end": 534.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and most desirable above all other fruits;",
      "verse": "15:36",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 535.158,
      "end": 538.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and it is the greatest of all the gifts of God.",
      "verse": "15:36",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 538.682,
      "end": 541.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus I spake unto my brethren.",
      "verse": "15:36",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 541.184,
      "end": 542.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "15:36",
      "lineIndex": 162
    }
  ]
}